  "creative_findings": [
    "Blue-side baseline WR 53.2% but first-dragon rate only 40.2% while first-herald 60.0% and mean grub_diff +0.68 \u2014 blue wins the *grub/herald* layer more than the *drake* layer.",
    "First-obj \u0394WR (blue takes vs misses): firstblood +19.1pp, firstdragon +20.7pp, firstherald +26.5pp, firstbaron +62.8pp, firsttower +39.1pp \u2014 Herald (+26pp) punches above FD (+21pp); Baron is the nuke (+63pp).",
